<section aria-labelledby="demo-h">
  <h2 id="demo-h" class="type-h2">Credits</h2>
  <p>Credits is the only full-width band on a case study that uses the secondary yellow. It is optional. When it is used it sits under the <a href="/components/outcome/">Outcome</a> and above the <a href="/components/disclaimer/">Disclaimer</a>. It lists roles, one per line. It uses the same two-column row as the <a href="/components/section-split/">Section split</a>. The text below is placeholder text.</p>
