<section aria-labelledby="color-h">
  <h2 id="color-h" class="type-h2">Color</h2>
  <p>The band is <code>surface/brand/secondary/band</code>. The heading is <code>text/on-secondary/primary</code> and the list is <code>text/on-secondary/body</code>. The text is near-black on yellow in both Light and Dark.</p>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="use-h">
  <h2 id="use-h" class="type-h2">Using the credits</h2>
  <div class="rules">
    <div class="rule"><h3 class="type-h3">Do</h3><ul>
      <li>List roles, not names, and say what each role did.</li>
      <li>Add a person's name only if they have agreed to be named.</li>
      <li>Leave the band out when it does not apply.</li>
    </ul></div>
    <div class="rule"><h3 class="type-h3">Don't</h3><ul>
      <li>Use the yellow band for anything other than credits.</li>
      <li>Name a client contact without their agreement.</li>
    </ul></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section aria-labelledby="a11y-h">
  <h2 id="a11y-h" class="type-h2">Accessibility</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The band is a <code>&lt;section&gt;</code> named by its <code>h2</code>. The list is a real list.</li>
    <li>The text is near-black on yellow in both Light and Dark.</li>
  </ul>
</section>
